{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:LiftingAndDescent.ArcSpace","@type":"LeanModule","name":"LiftingAndDescent.ArcSpace","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Logic.Basic"],"declarations":12,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.ArcSpace.compatible","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.ArcSpace.compatible","kind":"theorem","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/arc-space.lean#L34-L34","doc":"Compatibility with truncation: trunc_n ∘ proj_{n+1} = proj_n. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.ArcSpace.projection","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.ArcSpace.projection","kind":"def","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/arc-space.lean#L32-L32","doc":"Projection to each finite jet level. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.ArcSpace.Carrier","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.ArcSpace.Carrier","kind":"def","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/arc-space.lean#L30-L30","doc":"The carrier of the arc space (inverse limit of jet schemes). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.ArcSpace.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.ArcSpace.mk","kind":"ctor","line":28,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/arc-space.lean#L28-L28","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.ArcSpace","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.ArcSpace","kind":"structure","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/arc-space.lean#L25-L34","doc":"The **arc space** `L(X) = lim_{←n} L_n(X)`. Carries the\nformal data needed for motivic integration even when `X` is\nsingular. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:arc-space","label":"def:arc-space","md":"quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/arc-space.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.JetTower.truncation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.JetTower.truncation","kind":"def","line":23,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/arc-space.lean#L23-L23","doc":"The truncation map `L_{n+1}(X) → L_n(X)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.JetTower.level","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.JetTower.level","kind":"def","line":21,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/arc-space.lean#L21-L21","doc":"The n-th jet scheme. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.JetTower.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.JetTower.mk","kind":"ctor","line":19,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/arc-space.lean#L19-L19","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.JetTower","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.LiftingDescent.JetTower","kind":"structure","line":17,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lifting-and-descent/arc-space.lean#L17-L23","doc":"A **jet tower** for `X`: the family `L_n(X)` together with\nthe truncation maps `L_{n+1}(X) → L_n(X)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.LiftingDescent.JetScheme.Carrier","@type":"LeanDeclaration","